<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document>
<name>Haebangchon – 7 places from 'Play Yoni' (Sinheung Market food tour)</name>
<description><![CDATA[Seven restaurants and cafés in and around Sinheung Market, Haebangchon (Yongsan-gu, Seoul), from the YouTube video '이태원 신흥시장 7곳 털고 왔습니다' (youtu.be/9hhh9yxNeAE). Coordinates from Naver Map. Tip from the video: most market shops take Onnuri mobile gift cards, which give 5–10% off.]]></description>
